{"seq":3,"slug":"typography-tokens","title":"排版令牌","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/token-architecture/typography-tokens","wordCount":1905,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"排版令牌\">排版令牌</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>排版令牌（Typography Token）系统化管理字体决策——包括字体族（Font Family）、字号阶梯（Type Scale，如标题层级和正文字号）、字重（Weight）、行高（Line Height）和字间距（Letter Spacing）。字号阶梯是排版系统的核心——基于音乐比例（如 1.125 小二度、1.25 大三度、1.5 纯五度、1.618 黄金比例）加上基准字号，生成系统化的字号递进序列。复合令牌（Composite Token，一个令牌包含多个子属性，如 <code>typography.heading.lg = {fontSize, lineHeight, fontWeight}</code>）与原子令牌（Atomic Token）是需要权衡的设计选择。网页字体加载（FOUT 与 FOIT 的区别、<code>font-display</code> 属性）、可变字体（Variable Font）和多语言支持是工程实践的关键。本节详细讲解排版令牌的架构设计、字号阶梯规划、复合与原子令牌的选择、字体加载策略和无障碍考量。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>令牌类别</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>所属层级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>字体族</td>\n<td>sans、serif、mono</td>\n<td>系统层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字号</td>\n<td>typography.body.md</td>\n<td>系统层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字重</td>\n<td>regular、medium、bold</td>\n<td>引用层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行高</td>\n<td>tight、normal、relaxed</td>\n<td>引用层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字间距</td>\n<td>tight、normal、wide</td>\n<td>引用层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复合令牌</td>\n<td>heading.lg、body.md</td>\n<td>系统层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>字号阶梯的生成遵循「基准字号 × 比例系数的 n 次方」这一链条，再分别落成原子令牌与复合令牌：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;基准字号 16px&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;乘以比例系数 1.25 的 n 次方&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;字号阶梯 xs 至 6xl&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;原子令牌 fontSize.*&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E[&quot;复合令牌 typography.body.md&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F[&quot;Style Dictionary 构建&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F\">graph TD\n  A[\"基准字号 16px\"] --&gt; B[\"乘以比例系数 1.25 的 n 次方\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"字号阶梯 xs 至 6xl\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"原子令牌 fontSize.*\"]\n  C --&gt; E[\"复合令牌 typography.body.md\"]\n  D --&gt; F[\"Style Dictionary 构建\"]\n  E --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"字号阶梯\">字号阶梯</h2><p><strong>基于比例系数的阶梯</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>1.125（小二度）：变化微妙。</li>\n<li>1.25（大三度）：均衡适中（推荐默认值）。</li>\n<li>1.333（纯四度）：对比鲜明。</li>\n<li>1.5（纯五度）：差异显著。</li>\n<li>1.618（黄金比例）：极具戏剧性。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>生成方法</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基准字号（16px）× 比例系数的 n 次方。</li>\n<li>例如比例 1.25、基准 16px：16, 20, 25, 31, 39, 49, 61。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>令牌定义</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;fontSize&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;xs&quot;: &quot;12px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;sm&quot;: &quot;14px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;md&quot;: &quot;16px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;lg&quot;: &quot;18px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;xl&quot;: &quot;20px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;2xl&quot;: &quot;24px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;3xl&quot;: &quot;30px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;4xl&quot;: &quot;36px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;5xl&quot;: &quot;48px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;6xl&quot;: &quot;60px&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"fontSize\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"xs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"12px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"sm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"14px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"md\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"16px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"18px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"xl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"20px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"2xl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"24px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"3xl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"30px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"4xl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"36px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"5xl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"48px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"6xl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"60px\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>常用工具</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>typescale.com。</li>\n<li>modularscale.com。</li>\n<li>Tailwind 默认阶梯。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"复合令牌\">复合令牌</h2><p><strong>原子令牌</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个属性单独定义一个令牌。</li>\n<li><code>fontSize.md</code> 和 <code>lineHeight.normal</code> 分开管理。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>复合令牌</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一个令牌包含多个属性：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;typography.body.md&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;fontSize&quot;: &quot;16px&quot;,&#10;    &quot;lineHeight&quot;: &quot;1.5&quot;,&#10;    &quot;fontWeight&quot;: &quot;400&quot;,&#10;    &quot;letterSpacing&quot;: &quot;0&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"typography.body.md\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"fontSize\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"16px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lineHeight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"fontWeight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"400\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"letterSpacing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>复合令牌的优势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用一个令牌即可获取全部属性。</li>\n<li>设计师无需自行组合搭配。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>原子令牌的优势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>组合更灵活。</li>\n<li>行高等属性可跨多个字号复用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>最佳实践</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>原子令牌用于基础属性。</li>\n<li>复合令牌用于常用组合（如 heading-1、body-md）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"常见排版模式\">常见排版模式</h2><p><strong>标题</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;typography.heading.1&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;fontSize&quot;: &quot;{fontSize.4xl}&quot;,&#10;    &quot;lineHeight&quot;: &quot;1.2&quot;,&#10;    &quot;fontWeight&quot;: &quot;{fontWeight.bold}&quot;,&#10;    &quot;letterSpacing&quot;: &quot;-0.02em&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;typography.heading.2&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;fontSize&quot;: &quot;{fontSize.3xl}&quot;,&#10;    &quot;lineHeight&quot;: &quot;1.25&quot;,&#10;    &quot;fontWeight&quot;: &quot;{fontWeight.bold}&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"typography.heading.1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"fontSize\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{fontSize.4xl}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lineHeight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"fontWeight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{fontWeight.bold}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"letterSpacing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"-0.02em\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"typography.heading.2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"fontSize\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{fontSize.3xl}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lineHeight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.25\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"fontWeight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{fontWeight.bold}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>正文</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;typography.body.md&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;fontSize&quot;: &quot;{fontSize.md}&quot;,&#10;    &quot;lineHeight&quot;: &quot;1.5&quot;,&#10;    &quot;fontWeight&quot;: &quot;{fontWeight.regular}&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"typography.body.md\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"fontSize\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{fontSize.md}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lineHeight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"fontWeight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{fontWeight.regular}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>说明文字 / 上标</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;typography.caption&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;fontSize&quot;: &quot;{fontSize.xs}&quot;,&#10;    &quot;lineHeight&quot;: &quot;1.4&quot;,&#10;    &quot;fontWeight&quot;: &quot;{fontWeight.regular}&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"typography.caption\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"fontSize\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{fontSize.xs}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lineHeight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"fontWeight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{fontWeight.regular}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"字体族\">字体族</h2><p><strong>字体栈</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;fontFamily.sans&quot;: &quot;Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif&quot;,&#10;  &quot;fontFamily.serif&quot;: &quot;Georgia, serif&quot;,&#10;  &quot;fontFamily.mono&quot;: &quot;JetBrains Mono, monospace&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"fontFamily.sans\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"fontFamily.serif\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Georgia, serif\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"fontFamily.mono\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"JetBrains Mono, monospace\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>回退顺序</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>系统字体优先（性能最佳）。</li>\n<li>品牌字体次之。</li>\n<li>通用字体族最后。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>可变字体</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一个字体文件支持多个字重和宽度。</li>\n<li>减小下载体积。</li>\n<li>Inter、Roboto、SF Pro 都有可变字体版本。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"字重\">字重</h2><p><strong>标准字重值</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>100（极细）。</li>\n<li>200（特细）。</li>\n<li>300（细体）。</li>\n<li>400（常规/正常）。</li>\n<li>500（中等）。</li>\n<li>600（半粗）。</li>\n<li>700（粗体）。</li>\n<li>800（特粗）。</li>\n<li>900（黑体）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>令牌命名</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;fontWeight.regular&quot;: &quot;400&quot;,&#10;  &quot;fontWeight.medium&quot;: &quot;500&quot;,&#10;  &quot;fontWeight.semibold&quot;: &quot;600&quot;,&#10;  &quot;fontWeight.bold&quot;: &quot;700&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"fontWeight.regular\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"400\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"fontWeight.medium\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"500\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"fontWeight.semibold\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"600\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"fontWeight.bold\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"700\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>不建议使用 100/200/800/900</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>部分字体不提供这些字重。</li>\n<li>可能导致字体回退到默认值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"行高\">行高</h2><p><strong>令牌定义</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;lineHeight.tight&quot;: &quot;1.1&quot;,&#10;  &quot;lineHeight.snug&quot;: &quot;1.25&quot;,&#10;  &quot;lineHeight.normal&quot;: &quot;1.5&quot;,&#10;  &quot;lineHeight.relaxed&quot;: &quot;1.625&quot;,&#10;  &quot;lineHeight.loose&quot;: &quot;2&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lineHeight.tight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lineHeight.snug\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.25\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lineHeight.normal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lineHeight.relaxed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.625\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lineHeight.loose\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>使用比例</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>1.5 是正文的典型行高。</li>\n<li>1.2 是标题的典型行高。</li>\n<li>字号越大，行高系数应越小。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>使用无单位值</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <code>line-height: 1.5</code> 而非 <code>1.5em</code>。</li>\n<li>确保继承时计算正确。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"字间距\">字间距</h2><p><strong>令牌定义</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;letterSpacing.tighter&quot;: &quot;-0.02em&quot;,&#10;  &quot;letterSpacing.tight&quot;: &quot;-0.01em&quot;,&#10;  &quot;letterSpacing.normal&quot;: &quot;0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;letterSpacing.wide&quot;: &quot;0.01em&quot;,&#10;  &quot;letterSpacing.wider&quot;: &quot;0.02em&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"letterSpacing.tighter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"-0.02em\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"letterSpacing.tight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"-0.01em\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"letterSpacing.normal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"letterSpacing.wide\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0.01em\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"letterSpacing.wider\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0.02em\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>使用模式</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>大号文本：使用更紧凑的字间距（负值）。</li>\n<li>小型大写字母 / 按钮：使用更宽松的字间距。</li>\n<li>正文：保持正常字间距。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"字体加载\">字体加载</h2><p><strong>FOUT 与 FOIT</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>FOUT（无样式文本闪烁）：先显示回退字体，再切换。</li>\n<li>FOIT（不可见文本闪烁）：文本不可见直到字体加载完成。</li>\n<li>推荐使用 FOUT（对 CLS 指标和可读性更友好）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><code>font-display</code> 属性</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"@font-face {&#10;  font-family: &#39;Inter&#39;;&#10;  src: url(&#39;inter.woff2&#39;) format(&#39;woff2&#39;);&#10;  font-display: swap;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@font-face</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  font-family</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Inter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  src</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'inter.woff2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'woff2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  font-display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">swap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>可选值</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>auto</code>：浏览器默认行为。</li>\n<li><code>block</code>：短暂 FOIT，然后显示回退字体。</li>\n<li><code>swap</code>：FOUT 模式。</li>\n<li><code>fallback</code>：极短 FOIT，显示回退字体后不再切换。</li>\n<li><code>optional</code>：浏览器根据网络状况决定。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>推荐</strong>：正文使用 <code>swap</code>，装饰性字体使用 <code>optional</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自托管与-google-fonts\">自托管与 Google Fonts</h2><p><strong>自托管</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>加载更快（无第三方 DNS 查询）。</li>\n<li>隐私友好（无 Google 追踪）。</li>\n<li>可控缓存策略。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Google Fonts</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用简单。</li>\n<li>CDN 缓存优化。</li>\n<li>但存在 GDPR 合规担忧（德国已有诉讼案例）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>现代推荐方案</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <code>next/font</code>（Next.js）、unfont 等工具自托管。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"可变字体\">可变字体</h2><p><strong>一个文件，支持多字重和样式</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"@font-face {&#10;  font-family: &#39;Inter&#39;;&#10;  src: url(&#39;Inter-Variable.woff2&#39;) format(&#39;woff2-variations&#39;);&#10;  font-weight: 100 900;&#10;}&#10;&#10;.heading {&#10;  font-weight: 700;&#10;  font-variation-settings: &#39;wght&#39; 700;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@font-face</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  font-family</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Inter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  src</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Inter-Variable.woff2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'woff2-variations'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  font-weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 900</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.heading</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  font-weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">700</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  font-variation-settings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wght'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 700</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>文件体积减小（一个文件替代八个）。</li>\n<li>字重变化可平滑动画。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"无障碍\">无障碍</h2><p><strong>最小字号</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>正文推荐 16px。</li>\n<li>无障碍正文的极限是 14px。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>行长度</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>理想范围是每行 45-75 个字符。</li>\n<li>通过 max-width 约束。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>层级结构</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>视觉层级应与语义层级匹配（使用 h1-h6 标签）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>颜色对比度</strong>（见颜色章节）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>正文最小对比度 4.5:1。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"多语言\">多语言</h2><p><strong>中日韩（CJK）字体</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>中日韩字符与拉丁字符度量不同。</li>\n<li>需要单独的字体配置。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>回退策略</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"font-family: &#39;Inter&#39;, &#39;Noto Sans CJK SC&#39;, sans-serif;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">font-family</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: 'Inter', 'Noto Sans CJK SC', </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">sans-serif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>多文字系统测试</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>测试产品的多语言版本。</li>\n<li>根据文字系统调整行高。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"令牌与-tailwind\">令牌与 Tailwind</h2><p><strong>Tailwind 方案</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>内置字号阶梯。</li>\n<li>基于类名（<code>text-xl</code>、<code>font-bold</code>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>设计系统令牌方案</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>自定义阶梯。</li>\n<li>支持跨平台。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>结合使用</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tailwind 配置使用设计系统令牌。</li>\n<li>兼得两者优势。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"style-dictionary-实战\">Style Dictionary 实战</h2><p><strong>令牌 JSON</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;typography&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;heading&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;lg&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;fontSize&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;32px&quot; },&#10;        &quot;lineHeight&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;1.2&quot; },&#10;        &quot;fontWeight&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;700&quot; }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"typography\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"heading\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"lg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"fontSize\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"32px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"lineHeight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"fontWeight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"700\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>构建 CSS</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".typography-heading-lg {&#10;  font-size: 32px;&#10;  line-height: 1.2;&#10;  font-weight: 700;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.typography-heading-lg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  font-size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  line-height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  font-weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">700</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>或生成 CSS 变量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"--typography-heading-lg-font-size: 32px;&#10;--typography-heading-lg-line-height: 1.2;&#10;--typography-heading-lg-font-weight: 700;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">--typography-heading-lg-font-size: 32px;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">--typography-heading-lg-line-height: 1.2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">--typography-heading-lg-font-weight: 700;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"反模式\">反模式</h2><p><strong>1. 字号过多</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>定义了 20 个 fontSize 令牌。</li>\n<li>推荐 7-10 个是最佳范围。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 比例不一致</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>随意选取字号。</li>\n<li>缺乏系统性。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 固定像素值</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不支持响应式。</li>\n<li>应使用 rem 或 clamp。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 未测试字体加载</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>FOIT 时间过长。</li>\n<li>应使用 font-display: swap。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 未使用可变字体</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>多个字体文件 → 加载慢。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>6. 忽视多语言</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>仅测试英文。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>排版令牌系统化管理字体决策——包括字体族、字号、字重、行高和字间距。字号阶梯基于音乐比例（1.125-1.618）加上基准字号，1.25 是推荐的均衡比例，基准 16px 可生成 11 级阶梯（xs 12px 到 6xl 60px）。复合令牌是一个令牌包含多个属性（如 <code>typography.body.md = {fontSize, lineHeight, fontWeight}</code>），与原子令牌各有利弊，最佳实践是原子令牌用于基础属性、复合令牌用于常用组合。常见排版模式包括标题 1-6（4xl-md，行高 1.2，粗体）、正文 md（16px，行高 1.5，常规）和说明文字（xs，行高 1.4）。字体栈应系统字体优先、品牌字体次之、通用字体族最后，可变字体用一个文件支持多字重，减小下载体积。标准字重为 100-900，令牌命名常用 regular/medium/semibold/bold（400/500/600/700）。行高正文 1.5、标题 1.2，使用无单位值确保继承正确。字间距大号文本更紧凑、小型大写字母更宽松。字体加载推荐 FOUT 模式而非 FOIT，建议使用 font-display: swap。自托管比 Google Fonts 更快、隐私友好且符合 GDPR（现代方案如 next/font）。可变字体一个文件支持多字重和平滑动画。无障碍要求正文最小 16px、行长度 45-75 字符、视觉与语义层级匹配、对比度 4.5:1 以上。多语言需考虑中日韩字体度量差异、配置回退策略和多文字系统测试。Tailwind 类名可与设计系统令牌结合使用。通过 Style Dictionary 可构建 CSS 类或变量。应避免的反模式包括：字号过多、比例不一致、固定像素值、未测试字体加载、未使用可变字体和忽视多语言。排版令牌是可读性和品牌一致性的基础——做好了能让阅读体验愉悦、品牌视觉统一、跨平台保持一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"排版令牌","id":"排版令牌"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"字号阶梯","id":"字号阶梯"},{"level":2,"text":"复合令牌","id":"复合令牌"},{"level":2,"text":"常见排版模式","id":"常见排版模式"},{"level":2,"text":"字体族","id":"字体族"},{"level":2,"text":"字重","id":"字重"},{"level":2,"text":"行高","id":"行高"},{"level":2,"text":"字间距","id":"字间距"},{"level":2,"text":"字体加载","id":"字体加载"},{"level":2,"text":"自托管与 Google Fonts","id":"自托管与-google-fonts"},{"level":2,"text":"可变字体","id":"可变字体"},{"level":2,"text":"无障碍","id":"无障碍"},{"level":2,"text":"多语言","id":"多语言"},{"level":2,"text":"令牌与 Tailwind","id":"令牌与-tailwind"},{"level":2,"text":"Style Dictionary 实战","id":"style-dictionary-实战"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式","id":"反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"颜色令牌与主题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/token-architecture/color-tokens-and-theming"},"next":{"title":"间距与布局令牌","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/token-architecture/spacing-and-layout-tokens"}}